66
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:22,080
But I definitely give a little side eye to that quick hot take from Fable.

67
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:27,520
Fable called it the carrot era that Apple is now offering more carrots.

68
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:35,360
